questiontext.text:
When a <code>Store</code> object is created with <code>new Store(10)</code>, what happens?<br><pre><code>public class Store {
    private Product[] products;
    private int total = 0;

    public Store(int numberItems) {
        products = new Product[numberItems];
    }
}</code></pre>

What is the purpose of the private method <code>isFull()</code> in the Store class?<br><pre><code>private boolean isFull() {
    return (total == products.length);
}</code></pre>

What is returned by the <code>add()</code> method in <code>Store</code>?<br><pre><code>public boolean add(Product product) {
    if (isFull()) {
        return false;
    } else {
        products[total] = product;
        total++;
        return true;
    }
}</code></pre>
